# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Student PII. The audit (§1) recorded these as excluded here; they were not.
# Verified before adding them: the built image contained seven spreadsheets,
# ~5.5 MB of named students tied to employers and salaries, readable by anyone
# with a shell in the container or access to the image layers.
#
# import_placements.py reads these from the repo root at development time. They
# have no business in a runtime image.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.csv
local_data/

# Destructive one-off ops scripts. Nothing routine runs these, and shipping
# them means a compromised container has a ready-made "delete every student"
# and "reset every password" to hand.
delete_students.py
reset_passwords_temp.py

# Test suite and fixtures - not needed at runtime.
tests/
pytest.ini
.github/
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
*.log
Thumbs.db
